  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Leads</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Leads is a joint programme of Plan International Netherlands, Defence for Children - ECPAT the Netherlands (DCI-ECPAT), African Women&#x2019;s Development and Communication Network (FEMNET), and Terre des Hommes the Netherlands (TdH). Equal Measures 2030 is a technical partner. This is funded MoFA The programme aims to increase sustained influence of girls and young women (GYW) on decision-making and the transformation of gender norms in formal and informal institutions. It is implemented in East Africa (Uganda, Ethiopia, Kenya), West Africa (Ghana, Mali, Sierra Leone, Liberia) and the Middle East (Lebanon, Jordan), with additional regional and and international programme components.</narrative>
  </description>
